sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as Citizen developer
    participant Hub as Central Hub
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant ID as Azure identity
    participant Fabric as Fabric workspace
    participant Repo as Rayfin repository

    User->>Hub: Open approved Rayfin request
    Hub->>GH: Validate request and generate repository
    Hub->>ID: Create managed identity and OIDC trust
    Hub->>Fabric: Grant identity Contributor
    Hub->>Repo: Set variables and configure Rayfin ID
    Hub->>Repo: Push configuration to main
    Repo->>ID: Exchange GitHub OIDC token
    Repo->>Fabric: Run rayfin up and verify status
    Hub->>GH: Protect workflows and Rayfin configuration
    Hub-->>User: Record repository lifecycle in issue
